<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Itau still a hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Itau still a hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said in a report it was maintaining its hold recommendation on Brazilian retail bank Banco Itau as the bank's profitability will continue limited.</p>
<p>-- It raised Itau's year-end price target to $550.</p>
<p>-- It said it was expecting modest growth in Itau's credit volumes with a contraction in margins for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Itau preferred stock was quoted at 550 reais, down 0.36 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
